.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover Arashi's story, his involvement with Lobo and deepen the Lore of the Bravery Universe.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040170/extras/08bedec3af0b1e09e9454bd09973c8dc.poster.avif?t=1752894099\" width=770 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040170/extras/08bedec3af0b1e09e9454bd09973c8dc.webm?t=1752894099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040170/extras/08bedec3af0b1e09e9454bd09973c8dc.mp4?t=1752894099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Statera Studio","Wired Dreams Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040170/e78055fa4e575e40103730d069547ddee2494afa/header.jpg?t=1752894099","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2024 Statera Studio. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3040170/214749196/16fca5ae6fac7deb857cb1987e27fd4b0542d156/1752450997/dash_av1.mpd?t=1752494403","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3040170/214749196/16fca5ae6fac7deb857cb1987e27fd4b0542d156/1752450997/dash_h264.mpd?t=1752494403","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3040170/214749196/16fca5ae6fac7deb857cb1987e27fd4b0542d156/1752450997/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1752494403","id":257168460,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257168460/movie480.mp4?t=1752494403","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257168460/movie_max.mp4?t=1752494403"},"name":"